VieNeuTTS Rust

A Rust rewrite of VieNeuTTSApp (https://github.com/NguyenSiTrung/VieNeuTTSApp),
both licensed under the Apache License 2.0.

This repository includes material from those projects:
- crates/vieneu-core/assets/voices_v3_turbo.json and
  crates/vieneu-core/tests/fixtures/ref.wav, from the vieneu 3.3.0 package.
- app/src-tauri/icons, generated from the VieNeuTTSApp icon.

Model files are not in this repository. They are downloaded on first use from
pnnbao-ump/VieNeu-TTS-v3-Turbo and OpenMOSS-Team/MOSS-Audio-Tokenizer-Nano-ONNX
on Hugging Face under their own licenses.
